  <li><strong>Item Segmentation:</strong> Separating fragile, valuable, and heavy objects.</li>
  <li><strong>Protective Packing:</strong> Using bubble wrap, packing peanuts, and custom foam for delicate items.</li>
  <li><strong>Boxing &amp; Labeling:</strong> Assigning room codes and contents to each box for easy identification.</li>
  <li><strong>Securing:</strong> Strengthening boxes with straps and tape, and placing heavy items at the bottom.</li>
</ul>

<p>With all boxes sealed and labeled, the team proceeds to safe transit. Vehicles are equipped with climate control, shock absorbers, and secure loading mechanisms. The movers use a “top‑to‑bottom, side‑to‑side” loading strategy to prevent shifting and damage. Real‑time GPS tracking and a dedicated customer hotline keep the client informed throughout the journey.</p>

